title: Pu_Entry3
---
    <<if $Scene3Done>>
        <<jump Pu_Scene3Idle>>
    <<elseif $CaughtBossFish>>
        <<jump Pu_Scene3Return>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump Pu_Scene3Intro>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Pu_Scene3Intro
---
GRANDPA: You know, they say there's a big one out there. Been ruling those waters a long time.
GRANDPA: Who knows. Maybe you're the one who finally lands it.
GRANDPA: Go talk to the fellow over there. He's been looking after my boat — take her out and see for yourself.
<<set $MetCaptainReady = true>>
===

title: CAPTAIN
---
<<if not $MetCaptainReady>>
    …
    PLAYER: (I should talk to Grandpa first)
<<elseif $CaughtBossFish>>
    …
    PLAYER: (Already caught it — better go show Grandpa)
<<else>>
//เดินไปหาคนขายเรือ
<<camera_shoulder_in "Dialogue System" "CAPTAIN">>
CAPTAIN: Here for the boat? She's your grandad's, this one. Give me a minute and I'll get her running for you.
<<camera_reset "Dialogue System">>
//ล่องเรือ ตกได้ปลาใหญ่ — ขับเรือออกไปตกเองหลัง dialogue จบ ไม่ block รอในนี้
<<set_boss_only true>>
<<force_next_catch "Dunkleosteus" 1>>
<<start_boss_catch_watch "Dunkleosteus">>
<<endif>>
===

title: Pu_Scene3Return
---
<<if not $CaughtBossFish>>
    …
    PLAYER: (I should go catch that big fish first)
<<else>>
PLAYER: Whoa… this thing's got some serious strength.
PLAYER: Could this be the fish Grandpa was talking about?
//และกลับไปคุยกับปู่
<<camera_shoulder_in "Dialogue System" "Pu">>
PLAYER: Grandpa! You're not gonna believe what I just caught!
GRANDPA: Hmm? …..Is that… the one?
PLAYER: Wasn't easy, I'll tell you that.
GRANDPA: You actually caught it?
PLAYER: Yeah. So, what should I do with it?
GRANDPA: Why don't we keep it in the aquarium? It'd make quite the first attraction.
PLAYER: You mean, actually keep it there?
GRANDPA: Why not? We've got the space. We just need to get the tank ready.
PLAYER: You really think people would come to see it?
GRANDPA: I don't see why not. Besides, there's something else.
PLAYER: What's that?
GRANDPA: The fish around here have been getting fewer and fewer over the years. I've a feeling this big fellow might be part of the reason.
GRANDPA: It's been hunting these waters for a long time. With it out of the sea, the smaller fish might finally have a chance to recover.
PLAYER: So keeping it here could help the fish out there, too?
GRANDPA: That's the hope, anyway.
GRANDPA: Come on, then. Let's give our new guest a proper home.
GRANDPA: Who knows? This might be the start of something good for the aquarium after all.
<<camera_reset "Dialogue System">>
<<LoadScene "MainScene">>
<<endif>>
===

title: Pu_Scene3Idle
---
GRANDPA: That big fellow's settling into the tank nicely. Thanks again for catching it.
===
